## 5. SCHEMA STRUCTURED DATA

### 5.1 Mengapa Schema Penting di 2026?
Schema markup membantu Google & AI memahami konten secara semantik.
Pada 2026, schema menjadi sinyal terkuat untuk:
- Featured snippets & rich results di Google
- AI Overview citations (Google SGE)
- Knowledge Graph entity recognition
- AI chatbot citations (ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity)

### 5.2 Schema Wajib — Organization / Hospital (di homepage)
```json
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": ["Hospital", "MedicalOrganization"],
  "name": "Medical Indonesia",
  "description": "Rumah Sakit & Layanan Kesehatan Terpadu terbaik di Jakarta",
  "url": "https://medical.web.id",
  "logo": "https://medical.web.id/assets/img/logo.png",
  "image": "https://medical.web.id/assets/img/hospital.jpg",
  "telephone": "+628898964355",
  "address": {
    "@type": "PostalAddress",
    "streetAddress": "Jl. Jenderal Sudirman No. 123",
    "addressLocality": "Jakarta Pusat",
    "addressRegion": "DKI Jakarta",
    "postalCode": "10220",
    "addressCountry": "ID"
  },
  "geo": {
    "@type": "GeoCoordinates",
    "latitude": -6.2088,
    "longitude": 106.8456
  },
  "openingHoursSpecification": [
    {
      "@type": "OpeningHoursSpecification",
      "dayOfWeek": ["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday"],
      "opens": "07:00",
      "closes": "20:00"
    }
  ],
  "medicalSpecialty": [
    "Cardiology","Pediatrics","Orthopedics","GeneralPractice"
  ],
  "availableService": {
    "@type": "MedicalTherapy",
    "name": "IGD 24 Jam"
  },
  "sameAs": [
    "https://www.facebook.com/medicalindonesia",
    "https://www.instagram.com/medicalindonesia"
  ]
}
```

