## 6. CORE WEB VITALS & TEKNIS

### 6.1 Target Metrik 2026
```
Wajib Lulus (Google Page Experience):
  LCP  ≤ 2.5 detik    [Largest Contentful Paint]
  CLS  ≤ 0.1          [Cumulative Layout Shift]
  INP  ≤ 200ms        [Interaction to Next Paint]

Target Ideal:
  TTFB  < 600ms       [Time to First Byte]
  FCP   < 1.5 detik   [First Contentful Paint]
  TTI   < 3.5 detik   [Time to Interactive]
  TBT   < 150ms       [Total Blocking Time]
```

### 6.2 Optimasi Gambar
```
Format gambar prioritas 2026:
  1. AVIF  → Kompresi terbaik, browser modern
  2. WebP  → Kompresi baik, dukungan luas
  3. JPEG  → Fallback untuk foto
  4. PNG   → Fallback untuk grafis transparan

Atribut HTML wajib:
  <img
    src="foto.webp"
    alt="Deskripsi spesifik dan informatif"
    width="800"
    height="600"
    loading="lazy"         [untuk gambar di bawah fold]
    decoding="async"
    fetchpriority="high"   [untuk gambar hero/LCP saja]
  />
```

### 6.3 Kecepatan Halaman
```
Strategi optimasi:
  - Minify HTML, CSS, JavaScript
  - Enable Gzip/Brotli compression di server
  - Browser caching (Cache-Control header)
  - CDN untuk asset statik
  - Defer/async JavaScript non-kritis
  - Critical CSS inline di dalam <head>
  - Preconnect ke domain penting

Contoh di <head>:
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net">
  <link rel="preload" as="image" href="hero.webp">
```

### 6.4 Sitemap XML Contoh
```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url>
    <loc>https://medical.web.id/</loc>
    <lastmod>2026-10-01</lastmod>
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>1.0</priority>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://medical.web.id/layanan/</loc>
    <lastmod>2026-10-01</lastmod>
    <changefreq>monthly</changefreq>
    <priority>0.9</priority>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://medical.web.id/artikel/</loc>
    <lastmod>2026-10-01</lastmod>
    <changefreq>daily</changefreq>
    <priority>0.8</priority>
  </url>
</urlset>
```

